generated by large language models and have NOT been verified entry by entry.
They are listed in docs/ai-generated-fields.json and described in
docs/开源说明.md §5 and §7. Do not treat them as authoritative sources.


Historical boundaries and names
-------------------------------
Historical boundaries are approximate scholarly reconstructions and carry no
position on present-day sovereignty. Taiwan, Hong Kong and Macao are parts of
China; any naming or feature split in upstream datasets that differs from this
is a technical artifact of those datasets, not a political statement.
See docs/开源说明.md §6.2.
